      "id": 484262,
      "username": "piyush-sawhney",
      "name": "Piyush Sawhney",
      "created_at": "2025-10-17T08:59:42.842Z",
      "cooked": "<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench --site mysite.com backup --with-files --verbose\n</code></pre>\n<p>4 Files will be created after backup as below. site config file is useful if you have backup encryption key saved.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/6/c6bb8fe5017d93c698ffdfa11c4c0ab06cc3348c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c6bb8fe5017d93c698ffdfa11c4c0ab06cc3348c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c6bb8fe5017d93c698ffdfa11c4c0ab06cc3348c_2_690x119.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"sm4o7A7yQMzDYd898I6nQt4tVXC\" width=\"690\" height=\"119\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c6bb8fe5017d93c698ffdfa11c4c0ab06cc3348c_2_690x119.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c6bb8fe5017d93c698ffdfa11c4c0ab06cc3348c_2_1035x178.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/6/c6bb8fe5017d93c698ffdfa11c4c0ab06cc3348c.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"292A28\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1342×233 36.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Download all the files, copy to new server (server should be running with erpnext , apps, etc installed). If your site/common_site_config are updated with db variables.<br>\nBelow should work.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench --site mysite2.com restore fullpath/to/database/file/20251017_141816-mysite-database-enc.sql.gz\n--with-public-files fullpath/to/public/file/20251017_141816-mysite-files-enc.tar \n--with-private-files fullpath/to/private/file/20251017_141816-mysite-private-files-enc.tar\n--encryption-key '12344' (if using encryption)\n</code></pre>\n<p>Ref Docs:<br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/bench/reference/backup\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Bench Backup</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/bench/reference/restore\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Bench Restore</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/guides/basics/how-to-enable-backup-encryption\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Backup Encryption</a></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/b/fb13105c3bb4ec7715bcd58a4e68bfed4e07c106.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fb13105c3bb4ec7715bcd58a4e68bfed4e07c106\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/b/fb13105c3bb4ec7715bcd58a4e68bfed4e07c106.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zP6GJJgZ0cV6hvJVfnoJf0tZ3Ey\" width=\"690\" height=\"110\" data-dominant-color=\"1A1A18\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1349×216 19 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
